     "name": "Steven Stamkos",
     "description": "Tampa Bay Lightning captain Steven Stamkos becomes the 47th player in NHL history to join the 500-goal club. During the first period in Vancouver, the two-time Maurice \u201cRocket\u201d Richard Trophy winner goes to the net while teammate Alex Killorn makes a nice move to get around a defender before feeding Stamkos for the tap-in goal. Teammates flood the ice to congratulate Stamkos, who ends up netting three goals for the hatty in a 5-2 win.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
